#. module: sale_shopee
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_shopee
msgid ""
"\n"
"Import your Shopee orders in Odoo and synchronize deliveries\n"
"============================================================\n"
"\n"
"Key Features\n"
"------------\n"
"* Import orders from multiple accounts and shops\n"
"* Orders are matched with Odoo products based on their internal reference "
"(item_id or model_id in\n"
"  Shopee)\n"
"* Support for both Fulfillment by Shopee (FBS), Fulfillment by Merchant "
"(FBM) and Fulfilled by Cross\n"
"  Border Seller (Hybrid):\n"
"* FBS: Importing the completed orders\n"
"* FBM/Hybrid: Delivery information is fetched from Shopee, track and "
"synchronize the stock level to\n"
"  Shopee\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ນຳເຂົ້າຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ Shopee ຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າໃນ Odoo ແລະ ຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນການຈັດສົ່ງ\n"
"============================================================\n"
"\n"
"ຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼັກ\n"
"------------\n"
"* ນຳເຂົ້າຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ຈາກຫຼາຍບັນຊີ ແລະ ຫຼາຍຮ້ານຄ້າ\n"
"* ຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ຈະຖືກຈັບຄູ່ກັບສິນຄ້າໃນ Odoo ໂດຍອີງຕາມລະຫັດອ້າງອີງພາຍໃນ (item_id ຫຼື model_id ໃນ\n"
"  Shopee)\n"
"* ຮອງຮັບທັງການຈັດການໂດຍ Shopee (FBS), ການຈັດການໂດຍຮ້ານຄ້າ (FBM) ແລະ "
"ການຈັດການໂດຍຜູ້ຂາຍຂ້າມແດນ\n"
"  (Hybrid):\n"
"* FBS: ນຳເຂົ້າຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ\n"
"* FBM/Hybrid: ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການຈັດສົ່ງມາຈາກ Shopee, ຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ຊິງຄ໌ລະດັບສິນຄ້າໃນສາງໄປຫາ\n"
"  Shopee\n"

#. module: sale_shopee
#: model:mail.template,body_html:sale_shopee.order_sync_failure
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"                <p>The synchronization of the Shopee order with reference <t "
"t-out=\"ctx.get('shopee_order_ref') or ''\">REF</t> encountered an error and "
"was not completed.</p>\n"
"                <p>Unless the order is cancelled in Shopee, no other "
"synchronization will be attempted.</p>\n"
"                <p>To schedule a new synchronization attempt, proceed as "
"follows:\n"
"                    </p><ol>\n"
"                        <li>Enter the Developer Tools.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Open the form of the Shopee Shop on which the "
"order was placed.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Navigate to the Order Follow-up tab.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Set a date for <em>Last Order Synchronization "
"Date</em> that is anterior to the last status update of the order.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Save the changes and click on the <em>SYNC "
"ORDERS</em> button.</li>\n"
"                    </ol>\n"
"                \n"
"                <p>If the problem persists, contact <a href=\"https://"
"www.odoo.com/help/\">Odoo support</a>.</p>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"                <p>ການຊິງຄ໌ຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ Shopee ດ້ວຍລະຫັດອ້າງອີງ <t t-"
"out=\"ctx.get('shopee_order_ref') or ''\">REF</t> ພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ.</p>\n"
"                <p>ນອກຈາກວ່າຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກໃນ Shopee, ຈະບໍ່ມີການພະຍາຍາມຊິງຄ໌ອີກ.</"
"p>\n"
"                <p>ເພື່ອຕັ້ງເວລາການພະຍາຍາມຊິງຄ໌ໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"                    </p><ol>\n"
"                        <li>ເຂົ້າສູ່ ເຄື່ອງມືນັກພັດທະນາ (Developer Tools).</li>\n"
"                        <li>ເປີດຟອມຂອງຮ້ານຄ້າ Shopee ທີ່ມີຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ດັ່ງກ່າວ.</li>\n"
"                        <li>ໄປທີ່ແຖບ ຕິດຕາມຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ (Order Follow-up).</li>\n"
"                        <li>ກຳນົດວັນທີສຳລັບ <em>ວັນທີຊິງຄ໌ຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ຫຼ້າສຸດ</em> "
"ໃຫ້ເປັນວັນທີກ່ອນໜ້າການອັບເດດສະຖານະຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງຄຳສັ່ງຊື້.</li>\n"
"                        <li>ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມ <em>ຊິງຄ໌ຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ (SYNC "
"ORDERS)</em>.</li>\n"
"                    </ol>\n"
"                \n"
"                <p>ຖ້າບັນຫາຍັງຄົງຢູ່, ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ <a href=\"https://www.odoo.com/help/"
"\">ພາກສ່ວນຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງ Odoo</a>.</p>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "

